StudySmart

AI-powered study platform built using React and ASP.NET Core Web API.

Features

For example:

User registration/login
Student dashboard
Study management
AI-based functionality
REST APIs
CRUD operations
Database integration
Authentication
Swagger API documentation

| Layer             | Technology            |
| ----------------- | --------------------- |
| Frontend          | React.js              |
| Backend           | ASP.NET Core          |
| API               | REST API              |
| ORM               | Entity Framework Core |
| Database          | SQL Server            |
| API Documentation | Swagger               |
| Version Control   | Git/GitHub            |

